Butler: Hello. Welcome to your final meal.
Butler: You two will take turns eating steaks. 8 of these 20 steaks are poisoned.
Butler: Each round, you may eat as many steaks as you want. However, you must eat at least one before ending the day.
Butler: Every time you eat a steak, you earn one point. You may use these points after your turn to purchase a powerup.
Butler: The game will continue until there is one survivor. Good luck!